WEBVTT

NOTE Captions timed proportionally by sentence; full transcript follows in lesson.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.816
Here is where human judgment changes the result.

00:00:03.816 --> 00:00:06.201
Highlight the ninety-five percent claim.

00:00:06.201 --> 00:00:09.063
Which approved timing record supports it?

00:00:09.063 --> 00:00:10.494
We have none.

00:00:10.494 --> 00:00:13.833
Now highlight the claim that performance improved.

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:18.126
Where is the verified comparison with a previous period?

00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:20.034
That is also missing.

00:00:20.034 --> 00:00:21.942
Keep the recorded counts.

00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:23.850
Withhold the unsupported conclusions.
